                                "sense_id": "ed3e379e-df98-3735-81fd-ff092876e8cd",
                                "text": "The dissent of knowledge and the dissent of ignorance, though disunited, are becoming too powerful for your knowledgeless Church; and you, at last, have consented to speak of its necessary reform!"
                            },
