                                "example_id": "dd418a27-40c2-4b9d-bd49-fa1f98d7cf00",
                                "sense_id": "ed3e379e-df98-3735-81fd-ff092876e8cd",
                                "text": "Ultimately and essentially there was only a luminous bliss, only a knowledgeless understanding, only union with unity in a limitless, undifferentiated awareness."
                            }
                        ]
